# --- Build output ---
/app/fyne/dist/*
/app/fyne/fyne-cross/
/app/fyne/cmd/app/fyne-cross/
openchat-node
openchat-client
openchat-keytool
openchat-app

# Stray files that `fyne package` / `fyne-cross` drop next to cmd/app's
# source during packaging (a generated metadata+icon-embed file, and — on
# at least one run — a throwaway go.mod/go.sum and a stray Windows binary).
# The GUI module has exactly one go.mod, at app/fyne/;
# app/fyne/scripts/build-client.sh also deletes cmd/app/go.mod
# defensively before every build, but it's ignored here too so a forgotten
# manual `fyne package` run can never get committed by accident.
/app/fyne/cmd/app/go.mod
/app/fyne/cmd/app/go.sum
/app/fyne/cmd/app/fyne_metadata_init.go
/app/fyne/cmd/app/*.exe
/app/fyne/cmd/app/*.apk
# Same story for a stray icon fyne/fyne-cross can drop at the Go module
# root when run from there directly — the real, tracked icon lives at
# app/fyne/cmd/app/Icon.png.
/app/fyne/Icon.png

# Go build/test/debug artifacts and editor swap files, wherever they end up
*.test
*.out
*.prof
__debug_bin*
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Игнорируем файлы с расширением .ignore
*.ignore

# Автоматически игнорируем любые текстовые ключи нод (заменяет ваши две строки)
/cicd/docker/secrets/node*_key.txt

# --- Secrets / key material ---
# Блокируем любые файлы окружения и приватные ключи в проекте
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
/cicd/docker/certs/

# Local runbooks with real infrastructure details (domains, IPs, private
# LAN addresses) don't belong in a public repo, even though the .gitignore
# above already keeps actual key material out. Remove this line if you
# specifically want to publish yours (make sure it's been scrubbed of
# anything you don't want public first).
openchat-deploy-guide.md

# --- Go workspace ---
# go.work itself IS committed (this is a two-module monorepo, see
# app/golang and app/fyne) — only the machine-specific checksum file it
# generates is ignored, same idea as go.sum but for workspace mode.
go.work.sum

# --- Runtime data ---
node_modules/
.npm
/cicd/docker/data/
/data/
*.db
*.log

# --- OS / editor junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Xcode / SwiftPM build & IDE state (regenerate, never commit) ---
# .build/ and .swiftpm/ are SwiftPM's own build cache; xcuserdata/ and
# *.xcuserstate are per-developer Xcode window/scheme state -- none of
# this is meant to be shared, and .build/ in particular can balloon to
# 100+MB of binary module-cache files (accidentally committed once in
# this repo's history -- see the cleanup that added this block).
app/xcode/.build/
app/xcode/.swiftpm/
**/xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
DerivedData/

# --- gomobile-generated framework (regenerate via
#     app/xcode/scripts/prepare-project.sh -- do not commit; see that
#     script and app/xcode/README.md for why, and
#     app/golang/mobile/doc.go for the underlying `gomobile bind`
#     command) ---
**/OpenChatMobile.xcframework/
